<title>CHINA: Delphi, Shanghai Auto in brake technology pact.</title>
<headline>Delphi, Shanghai Auto in brake technology pact.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp's Delphi Automotive Systems unit said on Monday it had signed an agreement licensing Shanghai Automotive Brake Corp to use its technology in producing brake system parts.</p>
<p>Delphi said the contract was for eight years and would allow the supply of locally made vacuum boosters, master cylinders and brake hoses to the local automotive industry.</p>
<p>The U.S. company gave no value for the accord.</p>
</text>
